{"type":"FeatureCollection","metadata":{"version":"0.1","fecha":"2026-10-26","autor":"Agente de Regeneración (NS_permacultura)","metodo":"MDE Copernicus GLO-30 (30 m), acumulación de flujo D8, pendientes y cotas; polígono del Macrolote 7 (Biopueblo V11.kmz)","nota":"Propuesta preliminar e ilustrativa de masterplan de permacultura. No reemplaza el relevamiento, la observación del sitio ni el diseño humano.","total_ha":998.1,"conservacion_ha":518.0,"cuenca_canadon_ha":2009},"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"pc-ribera","capa":"agua","nombre":"Franja ribereña · bosque de ribera","zona":"Zona 5 · bien común","descripcion":"Retiro ancho sobre el río: restauración del bosque ribereño con nativas, sin construcción ni animales. Los sauces exóticos se reemplazan de a poco, porque hoy sostienen la orilla; el sauce criollo se conserva.","nombre_en":"Riverside strip · riparian forest","zona_en":"Zone 5 · commons","descripcion_en":"A wide setback along the river: restoring the riparian forest with native species, with no buildings and no livestock. Exotic willows are replaced gradually because they hold the bank today; the native willow stays.","marca":"[criterio]","area_ha":12.2},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-67.318186,-39.109509],[-67.317891,-39.109333],[-67.317484,-39.109272],[-67.317162,-39.109375],[-67.317034,-39.109206],[-67.316214,-39.109073],[-67.315175,-39.108467],[-67.313985,-39.107409],[-67.313681,-39.107389],[-67.311165,-39.112423],[-67.311317,-39.112447],[-67.311393,-39.112801],[-67.311938,-39.113008],[-67.312054,-39.112868],[-67.314101,-39.108784],[-67.315692,-39.109775],[-67.316913,-39.110162],[-67.317504,-39.110176],[-67.318133,-39.112792],[-67.318504,-39.113163],[-67.319179,-39.11331],[-67.319083,-39.112277],[-67.318661,-39.110568],[-67.318215,-39.110464],[-67.318504,-39.110186],[-67.318442,-39.10962],[-67.318186,-39.109509]]]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"pc-planicie","capa":"produccion","nombre":"Planicie inundable · c